 scene, press and hold the touchpad to travel in the direction you are facing. Release the touchpad to stop/freeze the view. Double-click on the touchpad to select molecular objects and learn more about them. \nEnjoy!", "short_description": "Learn and experience chemistry on an atomic level. There are two modules: Stereochemistry and Molecular Geometries. \nTo enter one of the modules press and hold the Gear VR touchpad. Audio instructions are given, so head-phones are recommended for an optimal experience. In the scene, press and hold the touchpad to travel in the direction you are facing. Release the touchpad to stop/freeze the view. Double-click on the touchpad to select molecular objects and learn more about them. \nEnjoy!"}]}, "developer_name": "Magnus Norrby", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://educhem-vr.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://educhem-vr.com/", "publisher_name": "EduChem VR Sweden AB", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://educhem-vr.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "EXPLORATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US"], "supported_input_devices": [], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "620453415700521"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162716_1740457356263833_5307649687371644928_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Wi4AfVgOFoAQ7kNvwGPMWCU&_nc_oc=AdpYftHfqDeEOmmAy2lth7XdDWvTtOs9p81dScwFdXKCDOV7tIBgPlok45H-2halzrA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLslcZRZt4NNM9uYNpmzPuM